-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Approvals and sign-off</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>The client role</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>No Workspace required</li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-white p-7 shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold\">Workspace</h3><div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-muted\">Per internal seat</div><div class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"font-display text-[40px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em]\">$9</span><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] text-muted\">/seat · per month</div></div><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-primary mt-6 justify-center\">Start free trial</a><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2.5 border-t border-line pt-6\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Projects, tasks, and calendar</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Finance dashboard: revenue, MRR, profit</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Billable vs non-billable timesheets</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Business Brain AI</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Plain-English automation builder</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>240+ workflow templates</li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-white p-7 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold\">Combined Bundle</h3><span class=\"rounded-full bg-ink/5 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-ink\">Best value</span></div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-muted\">Workspace + Client Space</div><div class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"font-display text-[40px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em]\">$24.99</span><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] text-muted\">/mo · per seat + client</div></div><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-primary mt-6 justify-center\">Start free trial</a><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2.5 border-t border-line pt-6\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>All of Workspace</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>All of Client Space</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Save $3+ per month vs. separately</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>One bill for your firm</li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-white p-7 shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold\">Enterprise</h3><div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-muted\">Unlimited seats</div><div class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"font-display text-[40px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em]\">Custom</span><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] text-muted\">Tailored to your firm</div></div><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-ghost mt-6 justify-center\">Contact sales</a><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2.5 border-t border-line pt-6\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Everything in Workspace + Client Space</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>SSO / SAML and RBAC</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Audit log and data residency</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Custom fields, API, and webhooks</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[14px]\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Dedicated onboarding and support</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,32px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Questions PS firms ask us.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">Who is PYNGYN built for?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Professional-services firms, law, accounting, consulting, agencies, creative studios, and architecture practices. It&#x27;s not a generic project tool; every feature is designed around how firms deliver client work.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">What is Workspace?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Workspace is the operating system for your firm&#x27;s internal work: projects, tasks, calendar, finance, billable timesheets, Business Brain AI, automations, team skills, and 240+ templates. Every internal seat gets Workspace.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">What is Client Space?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Client Space is a branded client portal, sold standalone at $19/month per client, no Workspace purchase required. Each client gets their own isolated space showing their deliverables, status, and approvals. Firms that also want Workspace can bundle both for $24.99/month.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">What are the four roles?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Directors/partners see the whole firm. Managers see their engagements. ICs see their tasks. Clients see only their own Client Space. Role-based access is enforced automatically.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">How is PYNGYN different from generic PM tools?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Generic tools (Asana, Monday, ClickUp) have no concept of a client portal, billable time, engagement profitability, or firm-level finance. PYNGYN is built around the professional-services delivery model from the ground up.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">How long does setup take?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Most firms are delivering inside PYNGYN within a week. Import from your current tool, set up your first engagement, and invite clients to their Client Space, all on day one.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Tailored to your team · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=