://pyngyn.ai/solutions/professional-services#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/professional-services#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Solutions\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/professional-services\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Professional Services\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/professional-services\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/professional-services#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is PYNGYN built for?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Professional-services firms, law, accounting, consulting, agencies, creative studios, and architecture practices. It's not a generic project tool; every feature is designed around how firms deliver client work.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Workspace?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Workspace is the operating system for your firm's internal work: projects, tasks, calendar, finance, billable timesheets, Business Brain AI, automations, team skills, and 240+ templates. Every internal seat gets Workspace.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Client Space?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Client Space is a branded client portal, sold standalone at $19/month per client, no Workspace purchase required. Each client gets their own isolated space showing their deliverables, status, and approvals. Firms that also want Workspace can bundle both for $24.99/month.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the four roles?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Directors/partners see the whole firm. Managers see their engagements. ICs see their tasks. Clients see only their own Client Space. Role-based access is enforced automatically.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is PYNGYN different from generic PM tools?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Generic tools (Asana, Monday, ClickUp) have no concept of a client portal, billable time, engagement profitability, or firm-level finance. PYNGYN is built around the professional-services delivery model from the ground up.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does setup take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most firms are delivering inside PYNGYN within a week. Import from your current tool, set up your first engagement, and invite clients to their Client Space, all on day one.\"}}]}]}a:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"id\":\"main\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap pb-[60px] pt-[140px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"Professional Services\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 max-w-[900px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5.2vw,60px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\",\"children\":[\"One place to run your firm\",\"$L13\",\" and\",\" \",\"$L14\"]}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"]}],\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\"]}],\"$L20\"],[\"$L21\",\"$L22\"],\"$L23\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"children\":\"$L25\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$27\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L28\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/02mkr0z8o939x.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n29:I[22016,[\"/_next/stat